WEBVTT

00:00:02.390 --> 00:00:04.520
And so, let's all have a listen.

00:00:04.520 --> 00:00:06.270
Dear Hell...

00:00:10.030 --> 00:00:14.570
Jigoku mitai ni asobitai
I want to have a good time like Hell

00:00:14.950 --> 00:00:19.700
Jigoku mitai ni yasumitai
I want to rest like Hell

00:00:20.200 --> 00:00:24.540
Jigoku mitai na nidoneshite
I want to go back to sleep like Hell

00:00:24.540 --> 00:00:29.130
Teiji de agaritai
And finish work on time

00:00:29.840 --> 00:00:34.970
Jigoku mitai ni tabesugite
I ate too much like Hell

00:00:34.970 --> 00:00:39.720
Jigoku mitai ni nomisugita
I drank too much like Hell

00:00:39.720 --> 00:00:44.980
Aa sonna wake de
Ah, for these reasons

00:00:45.190 --> 00:00:50.230
Jigoku mitai
It's like Hell

00:00:50.230 --> 00:00:52.650
Sonna toki koso deban desu
At such a time it's all the more his turn on stage

00:00:52.650 --> 00:00:55.320
Hoozuki-sama ga moriageru
Mr. Hozuki livens things up

00:00:55.990 --> 00:00:57.410
Omakase kudasai!
Please leave it to me!

00:00:57.570 --> 00:01:03.000
Aa jigoku jigoku mainichi jigoku
Ah, Hell, Hell, every day Hell

00:01:03.000 --> 00:01:05.580
Jigoku jigoku
Hell, Hell

00:01:05.580 --> 00:01:08.250
"Uso desho?!"
"You can't mean that, right?!"

00:01:08.250 --> 00:01:13.170
Jigoku jigoku youkoso jigoku
Hell, Hell, welcome to Hell

00:01:13.170 --> 00:01:14.010
Atchi muite
Look that way

00:01:14.010 --> 00:01:14.590
Kotchi muite
Look this way

00:01:14.590 --> 00:01:15.720
Abikyoukan!
Pandemonium!

00:01:15.880 --> 00:01:17.090
Gongo! Doudan!
What the hell!

00:01:17.090 --> 00:01:18.890
Shitsureishimashita!
Pardon me!

00:01:18.890 --> 00:01:23.890
Sonna kanji no
In that kind of way

00:01:23.890 --> 00:01:27.980
A! Jigoku desu! Jajajajan!
Ah! It's Hell! Ta ta ta-da!

00:01:27.980 --> 00:01:28.980
Katsu!
Curses!

00:01:35.360 --> 00:01:37.860
Excuse me, 10 ohagi, please.

00:01:37.990 --> 00:01:39.160
Got it!

00:01:42.950 --> 00:01:46.870
Huh? Miss, aren't you...

00:01:46.870 --> 00:01:50.790
Ah, that's it! You look just like Miki
from Maki-Miki, you know?

00:01:50.790 --> 00:01:52.460
That girl who says "meow."

00:01:52.460 --> 00:01:55.840
I like her quite a bit, you know.
She's a rather odd pop idol, though...

00:01:56.380 --> 00:01:57.340
You get told that a lot?

00:02:00.300 --> 00:02:01.970
All the time.

00:02:06.100 --> 00:02:09.270
Yakan Siblings

00:02:12.480 --> 00:02:14.070
I'm Maki!

00:02:14.070 --> 00:02:15.530
I'm meow-meow Miki!

00:02:15.860 --> 00:02:29.750
HELL ELECTRONICS

00:02:16.030 --> 00:02:19.240
Today we're coming to you from a zoo
in the Mundane World.

00:02:19.240 --> 00:02:21.990
We're here meow for a special report on the baby panda.

00:02:21.990 --> 00:02:23.120
First of all...

00:02:23.120 --> 00:02:25.450
That Miki girl is pretty cringy, you know?

00:02:25.620 --> 00:02:27.540
Really? She's cute.

00:02:27.540 --> 00:02:29.120
Huh?

00:02:29.120 --> 00:02:29.920
Meow!

00:02:29.920 --> 00:02:31.750
Maki-Miki

00:02:30.540 --> 00:02:31.790
Meow!

00:02:33.250 --> 00:02:34.380
You're just like her!

00:02:34.380 --> 00:02:36.800
Do boys really like that kind of thing?

00:02:36.800 --> 00:02:39.380
I mean, you girls like male pop idols, don't you?!

00:02:44.310 --> 00:02:50.400
Ah, Miki. You sure are super popular... meowadays.

00:02:51.270 --> 00:02:54.110
MEOOOOWWW!

00:02:54.230 --> 00:02:55.610
YIKES!

00:02:57.900 --> 00:03:01.450
Thank you kindly meow! I'm purrty grateful.

00:03:03.030 --> 00:03:07.120
I'm sick of it! I'm so tired of this persona!

00:03:07.700 --> 00:03:14.880
Eek! I-it would be a shocking picture,
but my conscience is telling me not to snap it!

00:03:15.590 --> 00:03:17.960
Ah, yeah, listen to it.

00:03:18.340 --> 00:03:22.550
What? What made Miki come over
to your place meow and cry her eyes out?

00:03:23.550 --> 00:03:25.810
Don't you just consider her something
of a younger sister?

00:03:26.060 --> 00:03:28.640
Hey, you're not her boyfriend, are you?

00:03:29.020 --> 00:03:34.190
Nah, some of the employees
at my workplace are Miki's brothers.

00:03:34.190 --> 00:03:37.980
Note: Another name for "fox" or "fox-like beast."
I see... That reminds me, Miki is a yakan, right?

00:03:38.610 --> 00:03:40.650
So she meows despite being a yakan, huh?

00:03:41.030 --> 00:03:42.240
Shouldn't it be "kon"?

00:03:42.570 --> 00:03:48.790
If I did that, it'd sound like I'm a huge advocate for CORN!

00:03:53.250 --> 00:03:55.920
Ah, I feel a bit better now.

00:03:57.040 --> 00:03:58.710
That girl's a waste of potential.

00:03:59.210 --> 00:04:02.010
Miki, you came to see your older brothers, right?

00:04:02.010 --> 00:04:03.970
They're here. Right over that way.

00:04:04.340 --> 00:04:07.260
YAKANKAN

00:04:04.640 --> 00:04:06.100
Oh, okay.

00:04:09.930 --> 00:04:11.270
I'm Ojiya!

00:04:12.480 --> 00:04:15.100
Woo-hoo! I'm Tortilla!

00:04:16.440 --> 00:04:19.110
Kon, kon-kon! I'm Hoya!

00:04:21.150 --> 00:04:24.740
Long time no see, Edabee, Hanabee, and Hanobee.

00:04:25.990 --> 00:04:29.040
Cut it out! Don't call us by our real names, Miki!

00:04:26.160 --> 00:04:27.990
HANABEE                    HANOBEE                    EDABEE
(TORTILLA)                     (HOYA)                      (OJIYA)

00:04:29.580 --> 00:04:31.290
Hm? Huh...?

00:04:31.750 --> 00:04:37.540
Wait, was this always such a fancy place?
It used to be a host club, didn't it?

00:04:37.840 --> 00:04:44.550
Ah, yeah, that's right. It's a long story.
It's a fox cafe now. And it's a huge success to boot.

00:04:44.550 --> 00:04:45.800
Is that so...?

00:04:45.840 --> 00:04:49.220
YANKANKAN
MENU
DRINKS
FOOD

00:04:46.090 --> 00:04:47.640
The name of the place changed, too.

00:04:47.800 --> 00:04:48.720
No kidding.

00:04:49.390 --> 00:04:54.140
I heard there was a slump in business, so I had
actually come to tell you to quit your host jobs...

00:04:54.640 --> 00:04:56.980
Well, we're fine now... just fine.

00:04:57.060 --> 00:04:59.940
More importantly, Miki, it's amazing
how popular you've become!

00:04:59.940 --> 00:05:02.940
Well, I can't take much more of this persona anymore...

00:05:03.740 --> 00:05:05.860
Er, never mind.

00:05:07.030 --> 00:05:10.740
At any rate, this place really has changed.
There are even couples here now.

00:05:11.330 --> 00:05:15.580
We remodeled the place, and now we also have
both male and female foxes working here.

00:05:15.920 --> 00:05:18.630
It's much better than an unpopular host club.

00:05:19.290 --> 00:05:25.630
Yeah. Surprisingly, we have lots
of male customers, too. Seen in that light...

00:05:30.720 --> 00:05:32.600
What's he doing with that... thing?

00:05:32.810 --> 00:05:34.560
More than that, he was here this whole time?

00:05:35.850 --> 00:05:37.980
How long have you been here?

00:05:38.190 --> 00:05:39.940
For quite some time now.

00:05:40.820 --> 00:05:46.570
I'm conscious of my eccentric behavior,
but Mr. Hozuki is quite eccentric himself in my opinion...

00:05:47.450 --> 00:05:52.740
Hello there, Miki. I wasn't sure who you were
for a moment. Is Maki doing well?

00:05:53.160 --> 00:05:54.700
Uh, yes!

00:05:54.700 --> 00:05:56.750
Oh? Miki, you also know him?

00:05:57.040 --> 00:06:00.000
He's the guy who gave us the idea
of making this place a fox cafe.

00:06:00.540 --> 00:06:02.880
Oh... My big bothers are in your debt.

00:06:02.880 --> 00:06:06.050
They're your older brothers, huh? It's a small world.

00:06:06.880 --> 00:06:09.840
So, does something bring you here all on your own...?

00:06:10.260 --> 00:06:15.680
No, I simply passed by the entrance. So I took
the opportunity to come in and do some thinking.

00:06:16.520 --> 00:06:17.690
Something wrong with that?

00:06:17.690 --> 00:06:19.980
No, please go ahead and stay as long as you like.

00:06:20.770 --> 00:06:24.070
Want me to change them back to foxes
and sit them next to you?

00:06:24.070 --> 00:06:27.070
Well, now that I've seen them in that form, it'd be kinda...

00:06:27.240 --> 00:06:30.320
Ah, you'd prefer female foxes, huh?

00:06:30.320 --> 00:06:31.530
Let's see...

00:06:31.870 --> 00:06:34.660
For the time being, Miki, take a seat next to him.

00:06:34.660 --> 00:06:35.830
What's the deal with that?!

00:06:36.540 --> 00:06:41.830
Ah, that's right. Miki, do you happen to be friends
with any male children's singers?

00:06:41.830 --> 00:06:42.710
Huh?

00:06:43.000 --> 00:06:47.170
No... In the first place, Maki is my only friend...

00:06:47.340 --> 00:06:49.220
But, why do you ask?

00:06:50.970 --> 00:06:51.970
This here.

00:06:53.300 --> 00:06:57.770
You see, I got a request to do a talk
on Hell Minions at a preschool...

00:06:58.100 --> 00:07:05.230
Hell Minions
&
Jobs

00:06:58.230 --> 00:06:58.680
Everyone, the job of Hell minions is torture,
torture, torture, and more torture.

00:06:58.680 --> 00:07:01.850
But if I just blab on and on about the job of Hell minions,
Everyone, the job of Hell minions is torture,
torture, torture, and more torture.

00:07:01.850 --> 00:07:03.270
the children probably won't listen.
Everyone, the job of Hell minions is torture,
torture, torture, and more torture.

00:07:03.270 --> 00:07:03.690
Everyone, the job of Hell minions is torture,
torture, torture, and more torture.

00:07:03.690 --> 00:07:05.320
That's true.
Everyone, the job of Hell minions is torture,
torture, torture, and more torture.

00:07:06.190 --> 00:07:11.410
I was thinking about using a puppet like this,
but I can't get into the spirit.

00:07:11.700 --> 00:07:14.490
Ah, so that's why you asked about children's singers...

00:07:15.240 --> 00:07:18.370
Uh, Mr. Hozuki, is that the amount of energy
you're planning to show?

00:07:19.040 --> 00:07:21.830
Try a test run, please. What'll it be like?

00:07:22.750 --> 00:07:24.590
Well, let's see...

00:07:25.210 --> 00:07:27.880
This here is a Hell bug...

00:07:28.880 --> 00:07:33.090
Hey, everybody. I'm a nikeichu,
who's highly praised for how gross I am.

00:07:33.260 --> 00:07:37.680
My special talent is finding punks
who assault diligent, hard-working women,

00:07:37.680 --> 00:07:41.810
going up their butts, crawling up their intestines,
and exiting out their brains.

00:07:42.100 --> 00:07:44.150
How about it? Pretty gross, right?

00:07:44.560 --> 00:07:46.360
Try to really picture it.

00:07:47.270 --> 00:07:49.690
With your monotonous voice, that's super scary!

00:07:50.240 --> 00:07:53.200
Sir, what the hell do you think you're saying
while inside a restaurant?

00:07:53.200 --> 00:07:54.410
I'll throw you out of here!

00:07:54.740 --> 00:07:56.580
HI-YAAAH!

00:07:56.740 --> 00:07:59.370
JUST TRY TO THROW ME OUT! I'LL EAT YOUR GUTS!

00:08:01.330 --> 00:08:03.120
Not acting much like a children's singer, are you?!

00:08:03.120 --> 00:08:05.170
He's a monster customer!

00:08:06.670 --> 00:08:08.550
The children'll cry, you know.

00:08:08.550 --> 00:08:11.550
I think it was good, see? It was amusing, see?

00:08:11.550 --> 00:08:11.880
Huh?

00:08:12.510 --> 00:08:14.550
I also found it easy to understand, see?

00:08:14.720 --> 00:08:17.260
It's quite nice when a presenter uses a puppet like that.

00:08:17.470 --> 00:08:19.640
You guys actually liked it?

00:08:19.970 --> 00:08:22.350
It was my first time learning about nikeichu.

00:08:22.810 --> 00:08:25.860
Nikeichu are insects that inhabit
the Realm of Devouring Fiery Bugs.

00:08:26.150 --> 00:08:29.320
They're long like bowstrings,
and they spew fire and poison.

00:08:26.400 --> 00:08:31.190
NIKEICHU

00:08:29.570 --> 00:08:31.070
I learned that in science class.

00:08:31.440 --> 00:08:33.240
That's impressive you remember that.

00:08:33.450 --> 00:08:36.700
Why there's such a disparity between
these brothers and their younger sister...

00:08:36.820 --> 00:08:39.540
Ah! You're making fun of us, aren't you?!

00:08:39.830 --> 00:08:42.040
Actually, we're pretty good
when it comes to quizzes, you know!

00:08:42.040 --> 00:08:44.920
In fact, I can recite all the way up to
the 6x column of a multiplication table!

00:08:44.920 --> 00:08:47.840
Note: He is mispronouncing "Fleming's Rule."
Flamingo! This is Flamingo's Rule, right?

00:08:49.840 --> 00:08:51.210
Foxes are surprisingly...

00:08:51.670 --> 00:08:54.380
Let me tell you, these guys are truly special cases.

00:08:55.300 --> 00:08:59.850
I'm absolutely no good at academic studies either,
but as you can see I'm at least able to run this cafe.

00:09:00.770 --> 00:09:05.190
Well, I suppose it's true that Nine-Tailed Fox
is an especially stand-out genius among us...

00:09:05.980 --> 00:09:12.280
Note: A folk tale about this exists.
After all, part of the daily routine of you foxes is
feeding horse poop-filled steamed buns to travelers.

00:09:12.530 --> 00:09:13.860
That's not a daily thing!

00:09:14.820 --> 00:09:18.620
But, these guys are great at shapeshifting, though.
Even better than Miki, in fact.

00:09:19.080 --> 00:09:21.410
Oh, so that's how it is.

00:09:21.410 --> 00:09:24.870
I'm not good at shapeshifting into
anything other than my current form.

00:09:25.330 --> 00:09:29.840
Is it kind of like how people are better
at either academic studies or physical training?

00:09:29.840 --> 00:09:31.210
Guess so...

00:09:32.050 --> 00:09:34.970
Miki was the only one of us who ever excelled
in her studies, after all.

00:09:34.970 --> 00:09:36.840
She even has her teacher's license.

00:09:36.840 --> 00:09:37.800
"Teacher"?

00:09:41.890 --> 00:09:45.890
Then, you must be good
at teaching people things, correct?

00:09:46.520 --> 00:09:50.980
I don't know if I'm good at it...
but I did undergo training for it.

00:09:51.570 --> 00:09:54.900
Moreover, you're an idol who's popular with children,

00:09:54.900 --> 00:09:58.200
and your older brothers are good
at shapeshifting, correct?

00:09:58.200 --> 00:10:00.570
Y-yeah, that's right...

00:10:02.620 --> 00:10:04.330
Then please help me.

00:10:10.580 --> 00:10:13.920
Boiling Water Preschool

00:10:12.960 --> 00:10:14.090
Hi, everybody!

00:10:14.880 --> 00:10:18.800
There are purrenty of animals
and bugs in Hell, you know!

00:10:19.260 --> 00:10:22.760
Meow allow me, "Big Sister" Miki,
to introduce them to you!

00:10:23.560 --> 00:10:27.430
Hey, Miki, these guys are yakan, right?

00:10:28.060 --> 00:10:29.350
Purrfectly correct!

00:10:29.350 --> 00:10:34.020
These foxes will meow shapeshift
into various animals of Hell.

00:10:34.780 --> 00:10:36.110
Kon!

00:10:36.110 --> 00:10:37.070
They're dogs!

00:10:37.360 --> 00:10:40.990
That's right, there are purrenty of dogs in Hell.

00:10:41.450 --> 00:10:43.200
Okay, next...

00:10:44.580 --> 00:10:46.200
they'll become bugs meow!

00:10:46.330 --> 00:10:47.450
Kon!

00:10:47.620 --> 00:10:49.830
Wow, they're my fellow bugs now!

00:10:50.080 --> 00:10:53.040
Whoa, amazing!

00:10:53.040 --> 00:10:54.300
Wonderful!

00:10:56.960 --> 00:10:58.470
Cool!

00:10:59.630 --> 00:11:03.140
Proposal
"Teach Me! Miki & Brothers"

00:11:00.300 --> 00:11:03.260
"Teach me! Miki and Brothers"?

00:11:03.970 --> 00:11:09.850
It seems that Miki's manager, who watched her
give that talk, got in touch with JHK, Jigoku Hoso Kyokai,

00:11:09.850 --> 00:11:11.650
aka Hell Broadcasting Corporation.

00:11:11.850 --> 00:11:13.360
You guys gonna be in the show, too?

00:11:13.610 --> 00:11:14.570
Yes!

00:11:16.030 --> 00:11:17.320
Are you okay with this?

00:11:17.740 --> 00:11:20.910
Previously, you grumbled that you've had
quite enough of portraying this character.

00:11:20.910 --> 00:11:23.700
Adding the persona of a children's singer on top of that...

00:11:25.030 --> 00:11:28.080
I'll keep on doing my best for meow!

00:11:30.660 --> 00:11:37.760
GREATER
INFERNO

00:11:30.660 --> 00:11:37.760
HELL'S
REALM
OF
DEVOURING
FIERY
BUGS

00:11:39.840 --> 00:11:41.090
HI-YAH!

00:11:43.800 --> 00:11:47.010
Shiro's Butt is in a Real Jam

00:11:50.060 --> 00:11:54.150
Although everyone who's appointed to the
Greater Inferno Hell's Realm of Devouring Fiery Bugs

00:11:54.150 --> 00:11:58.400
is a mid-level or higher Hell minion,
I'll remind you to be careful here one more time.

00:12:00.030 --> 00:12:05.620
Nikeichu have bodies roughly as long
as electrical cords and are thinner than wires.

00:12:06.160 --> 00:12:09.410
Accordingly, when they hide
in the crevices of rocks and such...

00:12:11.750 --> 00:12:14.460
they are extremely difficult to spot, so please be careful.

00:12:15.500 --> 00:12:19.800
Nikeichu have some amount of intelligence,
but fundamentally they're bugs,

00:12:20.010 --> 00:12:22.260
so they make no distinction between us and the dead.

00:12:23.380 --> 00:12:25.800
Butts are the only thing nikeichu are on the lookout for!

00:12:26.390 --> 00:12:28.850
Keep an eye on your butt! Your butt!

00:12:29.720 --> 00:12:31.430
That's a rather unpleasant warning...

00:12:31.890 --> 00:12:36.810
Even if one of the dead is eaten by a nikeichu,
they'll be restored to their prior state after a while,

00:12:37.520 --> 00:12:39.280
but that's not how it works for us.

00:12:40.360 --> 00:12:43.530
If you're feed upon by a nikeichu,
surgery will be performed on you immediately.

00:12:43.900 --> 00:12:46.910
In the worst case, you'll suffer continued aftereffects.

00:12:47.490 --> 00:12:51.330
Therefore, please don't fool around
or let your guard down.

00:12:53.120 --> 00:12:59.500
Special-Fiber
Suit

00:12:54.080 --> 00:12:59.300
Currently, we're donning this protective clothing
below our kimonos as we carry out our work.

00:13:00.300 --> 00:13:04.590
This is because they're unable
to bite through the metal and special fibers.

00:13:07.050 --> 00:13:14.100
Special-Fiber
Suit
Steel Loincloth

00:13:07.390 --> 00:13:14.140
A Steel loincloth or a special-fiber suit...
Please wear whichever of the two you prefer at all times.

00:13:15.440 --> 00:13:16.850
There was only one real choice.

00:13:17.860 --> 00:13:21.280
Other than that, just carry out
your torture-related duties as normal.

00:13:21.610 --> 00:13:24.490
Uh, are our heads fine without any protection?

00:13:24.820 --> 00:13:27.450
Nikeichu never aim for anything other than the butt.

00:13:29.200 --> 00:13:30.950
Setting aside your nose and ears,

00:13:30.950 --> 00:13:36.170
they instinctively know that if they carelessly enter
into your mouth there's a chance they'll be bitten.

00:13:37.580 --> 00:13:43.380
It's like how birds are programmed
to always swallow fish head first when they eat them.

00:13:45.590 --> 00:13:49.140
However, once one does get inside your body,

00:13:49.470 --> 00:13:54.270
sharp pain so bad you think it's the end times
edges gradually closer to your brain.

00:13:55.350 --> 00:14:00.560
You know, yesterday I saw a movie
from the Mundane World. It was called "Alien."

00:14:01.070 --> 00:14:01.770
Yeah...

00:14:04.110 --> 00:14:06.780
Why'd I end up watching it now of all times...?

00:14:07.110 --> 00:14:08.660
Yeah... right...

00:14:09.370 --> 00:14:12.740
Which is why loitering around while unarmed or...

00:14:21.630 --> 00:14:22.340
Hm?

00:14:22.460 --> 00:14:24.460
Ah, it's Mr. Hozuki!

00:14:27.470 --> 00:14:28.090
Huh?

00:14:34.220 --> 00:14:37.270
What? Is something up?

00:14:43.190 --> 00:14:44.480
EEEEEK!

00:14:45.400 --> 00:14:47.190
What were you doing in a place like that anyway?!

00:14:47.530 --> 00:14:50.280
Waah! Waah!

00:14:51.120 --> 00:14:52.280
Shiro!

00:14:52.660 --> 00:14:57.290
At last, you've really done it! I knew
you'd screw up somehow or other eventually!

00:14:57.290 --> 00:15:01.790
How cruel! What do you mean "at last"?! How heartless!

00:15:02.080 --> 00:15:07.380
Well, I'm sorry, he said he wanted to take
an airborne stroll, and he just hopped on my back...

00:15:08.720 --> 00:15:10.340
Yay~

00:15:10.970 --> 00:15:12.890
You little...

00:15:14.510 --> 00:15:16.680
Hey, what're those down there?

00:15:16.680 --> 00:15:18.100
They're slithering around.

00:15:18.640 --> 00:15:19.520
I'm gonna go take a quick look!

00:15:19.520 --> 00:15:20.390
When I approached some boulders,
he just hopped down without asking permission.
I'm gonna go take a quick look!

00:15:20.390 --> 00:15:21.150
When I approached some boulders,
he just hopped down without asking permission.

00:15:21.150 --> 00:15:21.980
Hey!

00:15:21.980 --> 00:15:23.230
When I approached some boulders,
he just hopped down without asking permission.

00:15:23.480 --> 00:15:23.900
Abababababa!

00:15:23.900 --> 00:15:26.980
Mr. Hozuki, what's going to happen to him?!
Abababababa!

00:15:27.480 --> 00:15:29.820
An alien is gonna burst out of Shiro!

00:15:32.280 --> 00:15:36.030
Please just calm down!
I pulled the nikeichu out right away!

00:15:36.030 --> 00:15:36.830
Really?!

00:15:36.830 --> 00:15:38.870
So an alien's not gonna burst out, then?

00:15:39.540 --> 00:15:41.830
No alien was ever going
to come out from him in the first place.

00:15:42.040 --> 00:15:45.920
However, if we just leave him be,
a nikeichu may burst out of him.

00:15:45.920 --> 00:15:47.960
EEEEEEEEEK!

00:15:47.960 --> 00:15:50.510
I pulled it out right away, but it tore apart.

00:15:51.380 --> 00:15:53.760
Nikeichu have barbs on their heads...

00:15:54.260 --> 00:15:57.310
and they hook them to the walls
of the intestines to propel themselves forward.

00:15:58.180 --> 00:16:03.560
Those barbs broke off
and are currently stuck in Shiro's rectum...

00:16:04.560 --> 00:16:08.320
and as long as a nikeichu still has its head,
it'll regenerate its body eventually!

00:16:08.530 --> 00:16:13.030
In other words, it's like he has a suppository
that's gotten stuck part way in.

00:16:13.160 --> 00:16:16.490
No! I can't stand the thought of a suppository like that!

00:16:16.490 --> 00:16:18.040
Anyway, this isn't even medicine!

00:16:18.040 --> 00:16:19.870
Stupid Rurio!

00:16:25.670 --> 00:16:27.500
That's why we need to perform surgery immediately!

00:16:29.300 --> 00:16:32.130
Surgery? Doctor? Hakutaku?

00:16:32.590 --> 00:16:34.090
He's a pharmacist.

00:16:34.890 --> 00:16:36.010
To the veterinary hospital!

00:16:36.220 --> 00:16:37.260
Emergency

00:16:47.310 --> 00:16:50.150
Hell Minion
Veterinary Hospital
Emergencies                             Outpatient

00:16:50.940 --> 00:16:52.440
Excuse me! We have an emergency case!

00:16:54.320 --> 00:16:55.610
Right this way!

00:16:57.570 --> 00:16:59.660
NOOOOOOPE!

00:16:59.870 --> 00:17:00.740
What seems to be the matter?

00:17:00.910 --> 00:17:02.790
His butt's in a real jam!

00:17:02.790 --> 00:17:06.540
His butt! His butt... is a jam.
Kakisuke, calm down! I'll explain the situation.

00:17:07.040 --> 00:17:11.260
Eeeeek! Save me! Momotaro!

00:17:11.420 --> 00:17:14.590
Mr. Hozuki!

00:17:15.760 --> 00:17:18.140
Surgery
in
Progress

00:17:23.850 --> 00:17:25.810
I wonder if he's okay...

00:17:26.810 --> 00:17:28.560
How should I put this...

00:17:28.560 --> 00:17:32.820
To be honest, I thought something like
this would happen sooner or later.

00:17:32.940 --> 00:17:34.110
Yeah...

00:17:34.950 --> 00:17:37.160
I wonder if he'll be okay...

00:17:38.740 --> 00:17:40.240
Hey!

00:17:40.740 --> 00:17:42.540
Kakisuke! Rurio!

00:17:42.540 --> 00:17:44.540
Momotaro! Yasha-Ichi!

00:17:46.420 --> 00:17:47.500
What's Shiro's condition?

00:17:48.000 --> 00:17:49.880
Is he alright?!

00:17:51.670 --> 00:17:53.800
He's currently being operated on...

00:17:56.840 --> 00:17:59.550
We're all finished. He's fine now.

00:17:59.850 --> 00:18:01.470
You really mean it?!

00:18:01.470 --> 00:18:02.970
Can we see him already?!

00:18:03.470 --> 00:18:06.390
We extracted it quite quickly,
so it didn't end up being anything too serious.

00:18:10.230 --> 00:18:11.520
Shiro!

00:18:11.520 --> 00:18:12.900
I'm so glad, Shiro!

00:18:26.580 --> 00:18:29.540
What gives?! You guys are awful!

00:18:29.790 --> 00:18:32.790
Sorry! I'm sorry, but...

00:18:33.420 --> 00:18:37.260
Note: Moony Man. A brand of diapers in Japan.
Alright, starting today your nickname

00:18:33.420 --> 00:18:37.260
is "M*ny Man," okay?

00:18:37.260 --> 00:18:39.470
Jeez, even you're terrible, Senpai!

00:18:40.140 --> 00:18:42.760
I'm glad that you're safe and sound.

00:18:50.850 --> 00:18:54.360
Note: Dumplings from Okayama, the place most associated with
Momotaro.
Momotaro, you're awful, too!
You've got homely face that looks like a kibi dango!

00:18:54.980 --> 00:18:58.740
This thing's so uncool... What gives?!

00:18:58.740 --> 00:19:00.780
You swelled up a bit due to the poison.

00:19:01.280 --> 00:19:04.950
You were injected with an antidote,
and it seems you shouldn't suffer any aftereffects.

00:19:05.240 --> 00:19:07.120
Good... that's good to hear.

00:19:08.750 --> 00:19:12.330
You know, for a moment there,
I wasn't sure what was gonna happen to you.

00:19:12.580 --> 00:19:14.380
I'm glad you're fine.

00:19:14.380 --> 00:19:16.510
I'm not fine!

00:19:18.130 --> 00:19:21.340
You're all horrible! Stop laughing!

00:19:21.760 --> 00:19:26.640
Listen here... The reason everyone
is joking around and laughing,

00:19:26.890 --> 00:19:30.310
is because we all breathed a sigh of relief
that this didn't end up becoming a major disaster.

00:19:30.520 --> 00:19:34.110
And in the first place it's thanks
to everyone's efforts that it didn't become one.

00:19:34.440 --> 00:19:35.730
Show some gratitude.

00:19:38.860 --> 00:19:44.070
It was thanks to Rurio calling for a ghostly oxen cart
that you were quickly carried to the hospital.

00:19:44.530 --> 00:19:49.580
Kakisuke was panicking the whole time,
but that's simply because he was worried about you.

00:19:50.830 --> 00:19:54.460
The one who pulled the bug out of there
so quickly was Mr. Hozuki, you know.

00:19:57.090 --> 00:19:57.880
Yeah...

00:20:01.590 --> 00:20:06.600
Living free is well and good,
but you can't shirk away from taking responsibility.

00:20:10.520 --> 00:20:12.020
I'm sorry...

00:20:12.690 --> 00:20:15.190
Mr. Hozuki, what do you want us to do with this?

00:20:15.190 --> 00:20:17.230
Oh, I'll take that home with me.

00:20:18.650 --> 00:20:19.440
What is it?

00:20:22.110 --> 00:20:25.240
EEEEEEEEEEK!

00:20:25.410 --> 00:20:29.080
If we leave it be, it'll regenerate
and be able to do its work once more.

00:20:29.540 --> 00:20:33.620
We'll have you stay at the hospital for now, and then
you can head home when the swelling subsides, okay?

00:20:35.130 --> 00:20:39.000
Meals are served three times a day,
and you can watch TV whenever you like.

00:20:39.170 --> 00:20:43.050
Huh?! Does that mean I'm on vacation for the time being?

00:20:43.590 --> 00:20:45.800
Time to take it easy!

00:20:46.760 --> 00:20:49.010
Onto the next news item. Once again this year...

00:20:49.010 --> 00:20:50.720
What a calculating little piece of...

00:20:50.720 --> 00:20:53.980
Does he really understand the situation here...?

00:20:54.520 --> 00:20:59.690
Wonder if I'll get meat in my meal...
And what should I watch until then?

00:21:00.860 --> 00:21:03.360
At this time of day, I know just the thing to watch.

00:21:03.780 --> 00:21:09.660
Teach Me!
Miki
BROTHERS

00:21:05.360 --> 00:21:09.030
Teach me! Miki and Brothers!

00:21:10.830 --> 00:21:13.580
Hiya there, everybody, I'm a nikeichu.

00:21:13.580 --> 00:21:19.040
Today, once again follow along
with "Big Sister" Miki and me as we study Hell.

00:21:19.380 --> 00:21:22.210
NOOOOOO!

00:21:22.380 --> 00:21:24.970
Shiro, you're a fan of Maki-Miki, aren't you?

00:21:25.340 --> 00:21:28.300
This is a good show for Miki fans
since you can learn while watching it.

00:21:28.890 --> 00:21:30.720
Wh-wh-wh-whoaaa...

00:21:30.720 --> 00:21:32.600
This is what it means to learn the hard way.

00:21:32.600 --> 00:21:35.640
Yeah, it's about time you learn your lesson.

00:21:36.230 --> 00:21:40.150
When I spot a bad kid, I go up their butt and...

00:21:40.770 --> 00:21:42.070
EAT 'EM, GOT IT?!

00:21:42.070 --> 00:21:44.570
EEEEEEEEEK!

00:21:44.570 --> 00:21:49.200
Sorry, sorry, sorry, sorry, sorry,
sorry, sorry, sorry, sorry, sorry...

00:21:49.320 --> 00:21:52.200
SORRY!

00:22:05.010 --> 00:22:10.760
Uso yo. Janakya naze koko ni tadoritsuku no?
That's a lie. If not, why do you find your way here?

00:22:11.260 --> 00:22:17.350
Enma-sama no mae de nao shira o kiru no ne
Even in front of Lord Enma, you feign ignorance

00:22:17.810 --> 00:22:23.280
Baka ne. Dakedo sonna toko tamaranakute
You're an idiot. But I can't get enough of that aspect of you

00:22:24.030 --> 00:22:29.660
Teitaraku. Onaji tsumi kasanetsuzuketa
What a predicament. You continued to repeat the same sin

00:22:30.320 --> 00:22:34.950
Ii no? Yubikiri genman.
Is that alright? Pinky swear.

00:22:34.950 --> 00:22:36.330
(E?)
(Huh?)
Ii no? Yubikiri genman.
Is that alright? Pinky swear.

00:22:36.830 --> 00:22:41.170
Gachi ni honto ni naru yo.
It will seriously become reality.

00:22:41.170 --> 00:22:42.750
(Dogii!)
(Startling!)

00:22:41.170 --> 00:22:42.750
Gachi ni honto ni naru yo.
